	(text "Mode switches: back-to-back pairs, gates at +12 V_A. Both off at reset;\nthe logic device breaks one before it makes the other.\nVIN: F601 and D601 take a reversed supply. VIN_OV goes high above 5.5 V\nand the logic device then keeps the ampere switch open (blocks up to 30 V)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
